<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>AcmePetition.org</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/style.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@4.0.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" integrity="sha384-Gn5384xqQ1aoWXA+058RXPxPg6fy4IWvTNh0E263XmFcJlSAwiGgFAW/dAiS6JXm" crossorigin="anonymous">
</head>
<body>
    <div class="navbar1">
        <a class="nav-item" href="https://www.google.com">Home</a>
        <a class="nav-item"href="https://www.google.com">About</a>
        <a class="nav-item"href="https://www.google.com">Categories</a>
        <a class="nav-item"href="https://www.google.com">Contact</a>
    </div>
    <div class="petition-container">
        <div class="heading">Move CPTS 489 to Afternoon in Winter!</div>
        <div class="text-and-img-container">
            <div class="img">
                <img src="/images/Assignment2Image.jpg" alt="">
            </div>
            <div class="text">
                <p>
                    The image you see on the right is a representation of our professor every morning, right before his much-needed coffee that helps thaw him out a bit. Imagine having to wake up at 4 or 5 AM in the dead of winter just to prepare for class. Technically, since the sun hasn’t even risen yet, can we really call 4 AM "morning"? The frigid cold, combined with the mental fog of early hours, is an unfair battle both for students and faculty alike. No one should have to endure sub-zero temperatures just to attend an 8 AM lecture. Morning brain freeze inevitably leads to null pointer exceptions in our heads! For these reasons, we humbly request the administration to consider shifting CPTS 489 to a more humane afternoon time slot.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <hr>
        <% if (errors && errors.length > 0) { %>
            <div class="error-msg" style="display: block;">
                <ul>
                    <% errors.forEach(err => { %>
                        <li><%= err %></li>
                    <% }) %>
                </ul>
            </div>
        <% } else { %>
            <span class="error-msg" style="display: none;"></span>
        <% } %>
        <form method="post" action="/" class="petition-form" id="petition-form">
            <div class="heading2">Sign the Petition</div>
            <input class="information-box" type="text" id="name" name="name" placeholder="Your Name" value="<%= formData.name || '' %>">
            <input class="information-box" type="text" id="email" name="email" placeholder="Your Email" value="<%= formData.email || '' %>">
            <input class="information-box" type="text" id="city" name="city" placeholder="City" value="<%= formData.city || '' %>">
            <input class="information-box" type="text" id = "state" name="state" placeholder="State (e.g., WA)" value="<%= formData.state || '' %>">
            <select name= "type" id="signer" class="information-box" onchange="signerChanged(this)">
                <option value="placeholder" disabled selected hidden>-- I am a... --</option>
                <option value="student">Student</option>
                <option value="faculty">Faculty/Staff</option>
                <option value="military">Military/Veteran</option>
                <option value="professional">Industry Professional</option>
                <option value="other">Other</option>
            </select>
            <div id="signer-dropdown-container">
                <!-- Templates placed here in JS. -->
            </div>
            <textarea class = "information-box" name="comment" id="comment" placeholder="Leave a comment (optional)"></textarea>
            <span class="error-msg">Please fill in all required fields and select your signer type.</span>
            <button type="submit">Sign Petition</button>
        </form>
        <div class="submitted-signatures">
            <div class="heading2">Signatures</div>
            <table class="table">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Name</th>
                        <th>City</th>
                        <th>Type</th>
                        <th>Details</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody id="table-body">
                    <% signatures.forEach((sig, index) => { %>
                    <tr>
                        <td><%= sig.name %></td>
                        <td><%= sig.city %></td>
                        <td><%= sig.type %></td>
                        <td>
                            <a type="button"
                            class="more-button"
                            onclick='showDetails(<%- JSON.stringify(sig) %>)'
                            >
                            more >>
                            </a>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    <% }) %>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
    </div>
<!-- Templates for signer dropdown -->
    <template id = "student-fields">
        <label>What is your academic level?</label>
        <select name="academic-level" id="academic-level" class="information-box signer-information">
            <option value="placeholder" disabled selected hidden>-- Select --</option>
            <option value="freshman">Freshman</option>
            <option value="sophmore">Sophmore</option>
            <option value="junior">Junior</option>
            <option value="senior">Senior</option>
            <option value="graduate">Graduate</option>
        </select>
        <label>What is your major?</label>
        <input class="information-box signer-information" type="text" name = "major" placeholder="e.g., Computer Science"></input>
    </template>

    <template id = "faculty-fields">
        <label>Your role:</label>
        <select name="role" id="role" class="information-box signer-information">
            <option value="placeholder" disabled selected hidden>-- Select --</option>
            <option value="professor">Professor</option>
            <option value="instructor">Instructor</option>
            <option value="TA">TA</option>
            <option value="administrative">Administrative</option>
            <option value="research">Research</option>
        </select>
        <label>Department:</label>
        <input class="information-box signer-information" type="text" name = "department" placeholder="e.g., School of EECS"></input>
    </template>

    <template id = "military-fields">
        <label>Branch of service:</label>
        <select name="branch" id="branch" class="information-box signer-information">
            <option value="placeholder" disabled selected hidden>-- Select --</option>
            <option value="army">Army</option>
            <option value="navy">Navy</option>
            <option value="air-force">Air Force</option>
            <option value="marine-corps">Marine Corps</option>
            <option value="coast-guard">Coast Guard</option>
            <option value="space-force">Space Force</option>
        </select>
        <label>Status:</label>
        <select name="military-status" id="military-status" class="information-box signer-information">
            <option value="placeholder" disabled selected hidden>-- Select --</option>
            <option value="active-duty">Active Duty</option>
            <option value="veteran">Veteran</option>
            <option value="reserve">Reservist</option>
        </select>
    </template>

    <template id = "professional-fields">
        <label>Your industry sector:</label>
        <select name="industry-sector" id="industry-sector" class="information-box signer-information">
            <option value="placeholder" disabled selected hidden>-- Select --</option>
            <option value="freshman">Freshman</option>
            <option value="sophmore">Sophmore</option>
            <option value="junior">Junior</option>
            <option value="senior">Senior</option>
            <option value="graduate">Graduate</option>
        </select>
        <label>Company name (optional):</label>
        <input class="information-box signer-information" type="text" name = "company-name" placeholder="e.g., Microsoft"></input>
    </template>

    <template id = "other-fields">
        <label>Please describe your affiliation:</label>
        <input class="information-box signer-information" type="tex" name = "other-info" placeholder="Tell us a bit about yourself"></input>
    </template>

    <!-- Modal code -->
    <div class="modal fade" id="userModal" tabindex="-1" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="exampleModalLabel" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered" role="document">
            <div class="modal-content">
                <div class="modal-header">
                    <h5 class="modal-title" id="modalLabel">Details: </h5>
                    <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close">
                    <span aria-hidden="true">&times;</span>
                    </button>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-body">
                    <!-- Items added with js -->
                </div>
                <div class="modal-footer">
                    <button type="button" data-dismiss="modal">Close</button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <script src="https://code.jquery.com/jquery-3.2.1.slim.min.js" integrity="sha384-KJ3o2DKtIkvYIK3UENzmM7KCkRr/rE9/Qpg6aAZGJwFDMVNA/GpGFF93hXpG5KkN" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/popper.js@1.12.9/dist/umd/popper.min.js" integrity="sha384-ApNbgh9B+Y1QKtv3Rn7W3mgPxhU9K/ScQsAP7hUibX39j7fakFPskvXusvfa0b4Q" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@4.0.0/dist/js/bootstrap.min.js" integrity="sha384-JZR6Spejh4U02d8jOt6vLEHfe/JQGiRRSQQxSfFWpi1MquVdAyjUar5+76PVCmYl" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
    <script src="/javascripts/Petition2.js"></script>
</body>
</html>